WEBVTT

00:06:59.498 --> 00:07:01.876
And that summer he raised the money.

00:07:01.917 --> 00:07:05.087
He earned the money
to purchase his airline ticket.

00:07:05.129 --> 00:07:07.631
And he made a little bit more.

00:07:07.631 --> 00:07:09.341
And he bought me a gift.

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:11.385
But, you know, I'm like,

00:07:11.427 --> 00:07:14.305
I don't know really
who he was thinking about

00:07:14.346 --> 00:07:15.556
when he bought that gift.

00:07:15.598 --> 00:07:17.933
If it was, like, me or him, I don't know.

00:07:17.933 --> 00:07:19.101
(Laughter)

00:07:19.518 --> 00:07:23.063
But think about the confidence

00:07:23.063 --> 00:07:26.275
that this put in him at nine years old.

00:07:26.317 --> 00:07:28.110
That he can have a big goal,

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:32.198
and that he could persevere
to achieve that goal.